{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-transfer-matrix-identities","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:transfer-matrix-identities","kind":"proposition","title":"Transfer matrix identities: $T_{pp}T_{nn} = I$ and $T_{pn}^2 = [2]_q^2/4 \\cdot I$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-beta-decay-transfer-matrix","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-typed-crossing-operator"],"tags":["transfer-matrix","identity","hecke-algebra","inverse","binding"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.ParticleInteractions.transfer_matrix_identities","text":"transfer-matrix-identities.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:transfer-matrix-identities\"></a><p>The three typed transfer matrices satisfy two exact\nidentities in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{M}_2(\\mathbb{Z}[q^{\\pm 1}])</code>.</p>\n<h2>Statement</h2>\n<p><strong>(i)</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{pp} \\cdot T_{nn} = T_{nn} \\cdot T_{pp} = I</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>(ii)</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{pn}^2 = \\dfrac{[2]_q^2}{4} \\cdot I</code>, where\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[2]_q = q + q^{-1}</code>.</p>\n<p>The corollaries — nuclear binding from mixed crossings and the scalar\npairing per mixed-crossing pair — are collected in\n<a href=\"#rem:transfer-matrix-identities-context\" data-at=\"mass-theory/mass-algebraic-consolidated/mass-algebraic-transfer-skein\">the transfer-matrix-identity corollaries</a>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/transfer-matrix-identities.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"13.4.5","page":"b/prop-transfer-matrix-identities","qa":{"counts":{"pass":91,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":77},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Confinement.transfer_matrix_identities","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Confinement/transfer_matrix_identities.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
